# zoom-then-drag (h2-input): a drag starting mid-zoom (80 ms into a 400 px
# wheel), going on while the zoom finishes, released fast enough to glide.
# Behaviour: every frame moves the center further from the drag start (never
# back), the zoom reaches its target, one URL write after the glide stops.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 928 490
wheel 0 400
wait 80
down
move 1024 490 over 160
wait 300
up
wait 1500
shot zoom-then-drag
